@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Job a owl:Class.
hpc:Batchjob a owl:Class .
hpc:Outputfile a owl:Class.

hpc:submittedby a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:Submittedby rdfs:domain hpc:Job; rdfs:range xsd:integer.

hpc:outputfiles a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:Outputfiles rdfs:domain hpc:Job; rdfs:range rdf:List.

hpc:filesize a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:Filesize rdfs:domain hpc:Outputfile; r
